Lay a trap that creates a radius 5 gravitic anomaly when triggered by foes approaching within range 1.  Each turn, the anomaly deals [73, 85, 95, 103, 110 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; MAG 100)] temporal damage (based on your Magic) to foes while pulling them towards its center (chance increases with your combat accuracy or spell power, whichever is higher).

Each anomaly lasts [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5)] turns (up to the amount of time since the last anomaly dissipated, based on your Trap Mastery skill).

The trap may trigger more than once, but requires at least 2 turns to recharge between activations.

This design does not require advanced preparation to use.
